<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss post office to unveil insurance venture.</title>
<headline>Swiss post office to unveil insurance venture.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's state postal agency, which is branching into retail financial services, said it would unveil a joint venture on Friday to offer insurance products.</p>
<p>PTT Post said it would announce the name of its insurance company partner and unveil the product line in a Zurich news conference on Friday.</p>
<p>It declined to give more details.</p>
<p>PTT Post, which already offers payment cards, automatic tellers and federal savings bonds, last week announced it would start selling investment fund products at postal counters in a venture with Swiss Bank Corp SBC.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
